%% UI owners: packages/message/src/lib/components/dialog-header/dialog-header.component.ts:1；packages/message/src/lib/services/messageDialog.service.ts:1；src/app/message-host/runtime/im-gate/helix/helixTauriImGate.service.ts:1（实际命令与关联回灌）
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant UI as Angular UI
  participant Gate as MessageV3 Gate Port
  participant Native as Tauri Native
  participant FFI as Flutter FFI
  participant Web as Browser Web
  participant E as ExecutionShell Tick
  participant IM as helix-im
  participant Host as driver-host
  participant DB as tenant SQLite
  participant Go as Go IM Server
  participant WS as WS inbound
  participant Sink as EventSink raw bytes
  Note over UI,Gate: 用户目标：成员点进会话或点「全部已读」，该会话的未读角标与 @ 计数一起清零
  Note over UI,Web: 合同登记快照（不等于当前实现或实测）：mock=partial；helix=full；dual=yes；personaLocal=no；该图是交互合同，不把 Mock、HTTP 2xx 或静态注册写成真实 Green
  alt PC Tauri 入口
    UI->>Gate: channelsView(payload)
    Gate->>Native: invokeAccepted("im_channels_view", payload)
    Native->>E: Tick::Command(AppCommand)
  else Flutter FFI 入口
    FFI->>E: helix_command("im_channels_view", payload)
  else Browser Web 入口
    Web->>E: invoke("im_channels_view", payload)
  end
  E->>IM: ExecutionShell::step(Tick::Command)
  IM->>IM: 校验 整个会话标记已读 的入参，生成 corr_key/req_id
  IM->>Host: Effect::Http POST /api/cses/channels/view
  Host->>Go: HTTP request with tenant/auth/corr headers
  Go-->>Host: HTTP response（2xx 只代表 admission/query response）
  Host->>E: Tick::PortReply(http)
  E->>IM: correlate req_id/corr_key
  IM->>Host: Effect::PersistAtomic(projection + cursor)
  Host->>DB: transaction message read + viewer member + cursor
  DB-->>Host: PortReply(PersistOk)
  Host->>E: Tick::PortReply(PersistOk)
  E->>IM: release only matching authority corr
  IM->>Host: Effect::Persist ScopedGet(readback)
  Host->>DB: durable readback
  DB-->>Host: PortReply(readback)
  Host->>E: Tick::PortReply(readback)
  E->>IM: readback is the projection source
  IM->>Sink: Effect::Emit {event,data}（im:post:read，im:channel:update）
  Sink-->>UI: Native im:__bus__ 原始事件 → adapter 映射 kind → Angular 消费
  Sink-->>FFI: FFI batch raw {event,data}
  Sink-->>Web: Web EventBatch raw {event,data}
  alt HTTP / PortReply / Persist error
    IM->>IM: keep prior durable state；attach structured error to corr_key
    IM-->>E: Err or correlated error result
    E-->>Gate: controlled failure
    Gate-->>UI: error / empty state；不得伪造成功事件
  end
  Note over IM,DB: 关键效果：执行 channelsView 的当前 reader（Phase 1 receiver）在该频道的 unreadCount **绝对赋值为 0**（非 delta 递减）；重复调用幂等仍为 0；Go 在 channels/view 的同一事务中把 mentionCount / mentionCountRoot / mentionList / mentionUser 清零并回读绝对投影，Angular 原样替换后「N 条@」消失；只读依赖：groupedDialogs$ 比较器读 unreadCount 触发列表重渲；本 Gate 不得改写 lastPost / lastPostAt / 排序键；原消息作者（Phase 1 sender/actor）及其他未执行本次读取的成员，各自 getMemberUnread(channelId, userId).unreadCount / mentionCount 完全不变；不得复制或取反当前 reader 的归零结果
  Note over UI,Web: 关键负向：下游 messageDialog.updateDialog 收 UPDATE_CHANNEL 后必须先 Object.entries(patch) filter undefined 再 spread，禁止 partial patch 把本地已有字段（members / lastPost / draft 等）清空；Angular 不得在 channelsView 返回前本地写 unreadCount / mentionCount，也不得按 channelIds 数量或旧值推导新值；唯一权威是 Go update_channel 的绝对计数；Angular 只提交 channelIds；字段归一化只能由 Helix 公共 client_api 执行一次，进入 Core/Outbound 时必须已是非空 channels:[id,isRoot:true]，并以同一 camelCase 对象数组直达 Go；禁止新增第二层 snake_case → camelCase Adapter
  Note over E,Sink: 原始事件名（按触发分支）：im:post:read，im:channel:update；客户端 kind/action 由 adapter 映射，不是原始 Emit 名称
